{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/15d7929b4c457045c9372e710c4540a6.avif?t=1768739746\" width=1501 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the savior of the great Blue dynasty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Dynasty is a &quot;Rogue Lite&quot; game that combines &quot;Tower Defense&quot; and &quot;Hack and Slash&quot; genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/dc3e9d6cad40743f495080fcc5741b19.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/dc3e9d6cad40743f495080fcc5741b19.webp?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/66e3a2945d9a2917ec44783a706d2e7c.avif?t=1768739746\" width=332 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find new equipment, upgrade it, and dominate the dynasty map. The king will surely reward you for your efforts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/80b4fe255c445dd192d778904e764ddc.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/80b4fe255c445dd192d778904e764ddc.avif?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/483d1e4713b66771328d54b91a1f5d53.avif?t=1768739746\" width=332 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/fa0c45dd740e5ba9823b2f2e69e8fc5e.poster.avif?t=1768739746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/fa0c45dd740e5ba9823b2f2e69e8fc5e.webm?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/fa0c45dd740e5ba9823b2f2e69e8fc5e.mp4?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While conquering the map, don't forget to clear the dungeons. Dungeons are as bountiful as they are dangerous; if you believe you can succeed, don't hesitate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/dabd451b6d077b742263b93c828c8c00.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/dabd451b6d077b742263b93c828c8c00.avif?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/77ddf0dcbcf530b3ee17f1bd67271deb.avif?t=1768739746\" width=332 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/11708bf70912b5f66ce7fee07d22be47.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/11708bf70912b5f66ce7fee07d22be47.avif?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, to clear the entire map, you must complete all 3 levels of each region.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/247f5cb825f3f71d3bdea80f0c75cdf2.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/247f5cb825f3f71d3bdea80f0c75cdf2.avif?t=1768739746 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/4b319b7eff944822b419fdd0b5aad587.avif?t=1768739746\" width=332 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every weapon type you use has its unique skills. As long as you time your moves correctly, every weapon is powerful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.poster.avif?t=1768739746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.webm?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.mp4?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to use your &quot;Dash&quot; skill to vary your movement and evade enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.poster.avif?t=1768739746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.webm?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.mp4?t=1768739746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will level up as you fight. When you level up, you can gain permanent abilities that will support you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/4f1268a5d8e44fe1ab6ae9ef6cb13ac9.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/4f1268a5d8e44fe1ab6ae9ef6cb13ac9.webp?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PASSIVE SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before entering battle, you can improve your passive abilities with the experience points you have earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/228e4ab484897ca8954b5bba5a2f82fe.avif?t=1768739746\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/228e4ab484897ca8954b5bba5a2f82fe.avif?t=1768739746 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887660?t=1768739746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/bd823a7ed08412385ec96a8971211d9dbd6b09f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768739746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/3244eee70c1400a4fb38a7956622f4351dbc04f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768739746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/3244eee70c1400a4fb38a7956622f4351dbc04f3/capsule_184x69